WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.800
In FL Studio, instruments sit in the Channel rack and play patterns. Prefer tracks?

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.600
Turn on Track-only mode: Options, LYNX extras, or find it with Ctrl+F.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.400
LYNX offers each instrument a track of its own. Yes.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:26.400
Now one track is one instrument, and the Channel rack is out of the way.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.400
Click on a track to draw a clip: it plays that track's instrument.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:38.200
Each clip holds its instrument's notes: press Play to hear them.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:44.400
F6 still opens the Channel rack, with the same instruments.
